msgstr "संचयीका %1 बनवू शकले नाही"

#: kdm-theme.cpp:205
#, kde-format
msgid "<qt><strong>Copyright:</strong> %1<br/></qt>"
msgstr "<qt><strong>हक्काधिकार:</strong> %1<br/></qt>"

#: kdm-theme.cpp:208
#, kde-format
msgid "<qt><strong>Description:</strong> %1</qt>"
msgstr "<qt><strong>वर्णन:</strong> %1</qt>"

#: kdm-theme.cpp:220
msgid "Drag or Type Theme URL"
msgstr "सुत्रयोजना URL ओढा किंवा टाइप करा"

#: kdm-theme.cpp:239
#, kde-format
msgid "Unable to find the KDM theme archive %1."
msgstr "KDM सुत्रयोजना संग्रह %1 आढळले नाही."

#: kdm-theme.cpp:241
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Unable to download the KDM theme archive;\n"
"please check that address %1 is correct."
msgstr ""
"KDM सुत्रयोजना संग्रह डाऊनलोड करू शकले नाही;\n"
"कृपया पत्ता %1 योग्य आहे याची तपासणी करा."

#: kdm-theme.cpp:264
msgid "The file is not a valid KDM theme archive."
msgstr "फाइल वैध KDM सुत्रयोजना संग्रह नाही."

#: kdm-theme.cpp:267
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Installing KDM themes"
msgstr "KDM सुत्रयोजना प्रतिष्ठापीत करत आहे"

#: kdm-theme.cpp:276
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:progress"
msgid "<qt>Installing <strong>%1</strong> theme</qt>"
msgstr "<qt><strong>%1</strong> सुत्रयोजना प्रतिष्ठापीत केली जात आहे</qt>"

#: kdm-theme.cpp:317
msgid "Are you sure you want to remove the following themes?"
msgstr "तुम्हाला नक्की खालिल सुत्रयोजना काढूण टाकायचे?"

#: kdm-theme.cpp:318
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Remove themes?"
msgstr "सुत्रयोजना काढूण टाकायचे?"

#: kdm-users.cpp:97
msgid ""
"User 'nobody' does not exist. Displaying user images will not work in KDM."
msgstr ""
"वापरकर्ता 'कोणीच नाही' अस्तित्वात नाही. वापरकर्ता प्रतिमा प्रदर्शीत करणे KDM अंतर्गत "
"कार्य करत नाही."

#: kdm-users.cpp:105
msgctxt "@title:group UIDs belonging to system users like 'cron'"
msgid "System U&IDs"
msgstr "प्रणाली UIDs (&I)"

#: kdm-users.cpp:107
msgid ""
"Users with a UID (numerical user identification) outside this range will not "
"be listed by KDM and this setup dialog. Note that users with the UID 0 "
"(typically root) are not affected by this and must be explicitly excluded in "
"\"Inverse selection\" mode."
msgstr ""

#: kdm-users.cpp:113
msgctxt "UIDs"
msgid "Below:"
msgstr "खालिल:"

#: kdm-users.cpp:120
msgctxt "UIDs"
msgid "Above:"
msgstr "वरील:"

#: kdm-users.cpp:133
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Users"
msgstr "वापरकर्ते"

#: kdm-users.cpp:134
msgctxt "... of users"
msgid "Show list"
msgstr "यादी दर्शवा"

#: kdm-users.cpp:136
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, KDM will show a list of users, so users can click "
"on their name or image rather than typing in their login."
msgstr ""

#: kdm-users.cpp:138
msgctxt "user ..."
msgid "Autocompletion"
msgstr "स्वयंपूर्णता"

#: kdm-users.cpp:140
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, KDM will automatically complete user names while "
"they are typed in the line edit."
msgstr ""

#: kdm-users.cpp:143
msgctxt "@option:check mode of the user selection"
msgid "Inverse selection"
msgstr "उलट निवड"

#: kdm-users.cpp:145
msgid ""
"This option specifies how the users for \"Show list\" and \"Autocompletion\" "
"are selected in the \"Select users and groups\" list: If not checked, select "
"only the checked users. If checked, select all non-system users, except the "
"checked ones."
msgstr ""

#: kdm-users.cpp:149
msgid "Sor&t users"
msgstr "वापरकर्ता क्रमवारीत लावा (&t)"

#: kdm-users.cpp:151
msgid ""
"If this is checked, KDM will alphabetically sort the user list. Otherwise "
"users are listed in the order they appear in the password file."
msgstr ""

#: kdm-users.cpp:168
msgid "S&elect users and groups:"
msgstr "वापरकर्ता व समुह निवडा (&e):"

#: kdm-users.cpp:172
msgid "Selected Users"
msgstr "निवडलेले वापरकर्ता"

#: kdm-users.cpp:174
msgid ""
"KDM will show all checked users. Entries denoted with '@' are user groups. "
"Checking a group is like checking all users in that group."
msgstr ""

#: kdm-users.cpp:183
msgid "Excluded Users"
msgstr "वगळलेले वापरकर्ता"

#: kdm-users.cpp:185
msgid ""
"KDM will show all non-checked non-system users. Entries denoted with '@' are "
"user groups. Checking a group is like checking all users in that group."
msgstr ""

#: kdm-users.cpp:194
msgctxt "@title:group source for user faces"
msgid "User Image Source"
msgstr "वापरकर्ता प्रतिमा स्त्रोत"

#: kdm-users.cpp:196
msgid ""
"Here you can specify where KDM will obtain the images that represent users. "
"\"System\" represents the global folder; these are the pictures you can set "
"below. \"User\" means that KDM should read the user's $HOME/.face.icon file. "
"The two selections in the middle define the order of preference if both "
"sources are available."
msgstr ""

